    \section2 Qt Lottie Animation
    \list
        \li Added support for text layers.
        \li Added support for gradient strokes.
        \li Added support for animated paths in ellipses, rects and polystar shapes.
        \li Added support for stroke and fill animations.
        \li Added support for Auto Orient on layers.
        \li Added support for time remapping and stretching.
        \li Added LottieVectorImageController for additional, Lottie-specific control over
            animations.
    \endlist

