    \section2 Qt Qml Module
    \list
        \li Added new method insertRow to QQmlTreemodel to insert rows into
        specific positions in the model.
        \li Added new method moveRows to QQmlTreemodel to rearrange the
        structure of the model.
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt Quick Module
    \list
        \li Added \l{QtQuick.Shapes::ShapePath::strokeGradient}{strokeGradient} property to
            \l{ShapePath}.
    \endlist

